sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as REST API / Chat Service
    participant Dealer as Search Dealer (search.py)
    participant Tokenizer as Query Tokenizer
    participant ES as ElasticSearch / Infinity
    participant Reranker as Rerank Model

    Client->>Dealer: search(query, kb_ids, top_k)
    Dealer->>Tokenizer: Tokenize & extract keywords
    Tokenizer-->>Dealer: Terms & query vector
    
    par Dual Search
        Dealer->>ES: BM25 Match Query (Sparse)
        Dealer->>ES: Cosine Vector Similarity (Dense)
    end
    
    ES-->>Dealer: BM25 & Vector Candidate Sets
    Dealer->>Reranker: Re-score combined candidates
    Reranker-->>Dealer: Top-K reranked chunk list with scores
    Dealer-->>Client: Final SearchResult object
